@verbs vaults vault
@tier player
@title what a vault is, and how to put something in one

                                                          
                     Vault Information                    
                                                          
    - 'list' to get a list of all stored items.           
    - 'deposit <item>' to store an item.                  
    - 'retrieve <item>' to get an item from the vault.    
    - 'logs' to see the activity registry.                
                                                          